get little signs about where we should go next. The question is… are we actually listening? 3️⃣ What is your Ikigai? That sweet spot between what you love, what you’re good at, what the world needs, and what you can be paid for. We also talked about those moments when we feel we don’t deserve the next step. Those invisible blockers that quietly hold us back. Recognising them is the first step to removing them. My step one? ✨ Ask the universe. Thank you Emily, for such an inspiring and thought-provoking session today. Looking forward to the next one next week.\"\n            - link \"#leadership\" [ref=e119]:\n              - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=%23leadership&origin=HASH_TAG_FROM_FEED\n              - strong: \"#leadership\"\n            - link \"#careerdevelopment\" [ref=e120]:\n              - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=%23careerdevelopment&origin=HASH_TAG_FROM_FEED\n              - strong: \"#careerdevelopment\"\n            - link \"#ikigai\" [ref=e121]:\n              - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?keywords=%23ikigai&origin=HASH_TAG_FROM_FEED\n              - strong: \"#ikigai\"\n            - link \"Emily Edwards Coaching\" [ref=e122]:\n              - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/company/emily-edwards-coaching/\n              - strong: Emily Edwards Coaching\n          - link \"View image\" [ref=e123] [nth=2]:\n            - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/feed/\n          - button \"This image has content credentials.\" [ref=e124]:\n          - link \"4 reactions\" [ref=e125]:\n            - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/feed/\n            - paragraph: 4 reactions\n          - button \"5 comments\" [ref=e126]:\n            - paragraph: 5 comments\n          - link \"Open actor selection screen\" [ref=e127] [nth=3]:\n            - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/feed/\n          - 'button \"Reaction button state: no reaction\"': Like\n          - button \"Open react